Z||000007||Fierowrecker||10-15-2001||08:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroBUZZ:<BR><B>I had an old guy at a gas station on the weekend ask why I wrote PONTIAC on the back of my Lotus.  Told him my wife wouldn't let me drive a foreign car.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Gary<BR>86 GT<BR>86 SE</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Reminds me of this summer when I picked up the wife's car from the paint shop...<BR>Dropped by McD's and while I was eating and enjoying the great paint job, this fool walks up and starts to rag on me about driving "ferrin cars", ought to buy American, etc., etc...<BR>I walked him to the front of the car, point at the headlight cover and in a retarded voice I say "POOONNNNTTTIIIIAAAAACCCC"...<BR>He turned red and walked away...<P>------------------<BR>crash... The Fierowrecker<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/uploads/crash_sig.jpg">        <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||1
