Z||000010||Nashco||10-16-2001||03:04 AM||||What is wrong with people????  I mean, it's one thing to check out somebody's car, but to confront them about what THEY are driving?  Especially if you don't know what you're talking about...why not just be quiet and admire, or be glad it's not what you have??  I rarely say anything to people about their cars, and if so it's only if it's a car I know completely because I want one myself, or I always liked them.  Silly people....<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
